  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> A spotter shouts a correction to an ally's ranged weapon attack that would miss. Adds 1d4 and spends the spotter's reaction. The ally must be within 60 units and the target visible.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
